<metadata><name>Galičica trail MTB-6</name><desc>MTB-6 is one of Galičica National Park's mountain bike trails, some of them handy links between hiking routes. It's 6.3 km from near Peshtani (746 m) to above Trpejca (1,147 m), with about 426 m of climbing and 31 m of descent in the direction drawn, between 746 m and 1,149 m. https://galicica.finereli.com/trails/mtb-6/</desc><link href="https://galicica.finereli.com/"><text>galicica.finereli.com</text></link><copyright author="NP Galičica (trail lines), OpenStreetMap contributors (places, G-6)"><license>https://galicica.finereli.com/about/#license</license></copyright></metadata>
